# E11-M (many terms, preregistration §14) and T7-H (dictionary set, §15): exact queue commands. NOT EXECUTED by the agent.
# Printed by `python -m vsa_embed.experiments.e11_many plan`. Run from the main checkout's root after merging:
#   cd /home/bhux/workplace/VSA-LLM && PY=/home/bhux/anaconda3/envs/vsa-repro/bin/python
# Placement: priority 53 = after the queued E11 tier-1 evaluations (52) and the dev learning rate (51, which these jobs
